* HISTCL - CLEAR CONSOLE COMMAND HISTORY

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* HISTCL - CLEAR CONSOLE COMMAND HISTORY

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:HISTCL

Requests the History RSX command-line clear operation. If the RSX is
absent, reports History RSX not found. It does not install the RSX.

Clears console command history, not board messages, accounts, disk files
or HELPC navigation history. Keep history extensions private.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
